1
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:55,460
[Money]

2
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:58,280
[Children]

3
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,840
[Official]

4
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:03,360
[Blessing]

5
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,530
Whoever wrote this,

6
00:01:11,610 --> 00:01:13,539
follow them to see where they live.

7
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,930
Who wrote this?

8
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,970
[The Zhang family
will die a horrible death!]

9
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,180
[Fortune Telling]

10
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:32,570
[Li Yingjuan]

11
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,810
Wish you longevity.

12
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,640
Are you here for divination

13
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,920
or for the talisman?

14
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:50,840
Master,

15
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,870
my surname is Li.

16
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:54,150
I want to invite you to my house
to perform a ritual.

17
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,120
Sure.

18
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,190
What is it for?

19
00:01:56,470 --> 00:01:58,330
My niece is getting married soon.

20
00:01:58,550 --> 00:01:59,470
To read their Four Pillars of Destiny?

21
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:00,280
No problem.

22
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:01,600
No, no.

23
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,730
I want you to come to my house and help me

24
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,550
break them up.

25
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,470
Well...

26
00:02:06,750 --> 00:02:08,039
It's better to destroy ten temples

27
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,270
than one marriage.

28
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:10,320
Please

29
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,110
don't make it difficult for me.

30
00:02:12,110 --> 00:02:14,370
None of the Zhang family are good people!

31
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:20,430
They want to kill my niece.

32
00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:23,050
They want to...

33
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:24,600
trap her soul.

34
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:27,920
She's my only relative left.

35
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,240
I can't watch her

36
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,960
jump into a fire pit.

37
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:32,800
Why won't she listen to me?

38
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,670
She thinks I'm trying to harm her!

39
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:36,079
How could I...

40
00:02:36,210 --> 00:02:38,020
I have indeed heard of

41
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:40,520
the soul-trapping ritual
to change one's fate.

42
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,320
But this ritual is extremely wicked

43
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,760
and rarely done.

44
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,800
Ma'am,

45
00:02:45,670 --> 00:02:47,040
how can you be sure

46
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:49,079
that family did this ritual?

47
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:50,829
Because

48
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:53,430
our Li family

49
00:02:56,670 --> 00:02:58,360
did it before.

50
00:02:59,110 --> 00:03:01,200
The one trapped was from the Zhang family.

51
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,670
What a sin.

52
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,430
If we keep repaying one wrong
with another,

53
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:06,390
when will this cycle of vengeance
ever end?

54
00:03:06,390 --> 00:03:07,480
So...

55
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:09,760
Master,

56
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:10,760
please,

57
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:11,550
help me.

58
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:12,240
Alright?

59
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,670
We are willing to pay any amount.

60
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:15,070
It's not about the money.

61
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,010
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

62
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,710
We've been exorcising demons for 20 years.

63
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:20,760
We know our craft,

64
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,079
and we get results.

65
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,590
We'll take your case.

66
00:03:25,590 --> 00:03:26,079
Thank you!

67
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,079
Thank you, Master!

68
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:27,670
Thank you so much!

69
00:03:27,670 --> 00:03:28,670
Thank you so much!

70
00:03:28,670 --> 00:03:30,240
Then we are saved!

71
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,320
Thank you.

72
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,550
Thank you, Master.

73
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,040
Thank you.

74
00:03:35,270 --> 00:03:36,390
Thank you.

75
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:41,320
The Zhang family is where they are today

76
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:44,480
because the soul-trapping ritual
boosted their business.

77
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,390
They hired an evil Taoist
to perform the ritual.

78
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:48,360
Once our Li Ling
marries into their family,

79
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,240
they will stuff her alive into a vat

80
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,760
full of talisman water

81
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,480
to trap her soul,

82
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:57,670
so she can never be reincarnated.

83
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:02,800
Have you heard of
the soul-trapping ritual?

84
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,630
I've heard of it, but never seen it.

85
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:05,620
That requires killing.

86
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:06,750
But we don't do that.

87
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,930
Let's take a look first.

88
00:04:57,790 --> 00:04:58,909
Come on.

89
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,390
There's nothing here.

90
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,820
That old lady was so weird.

91
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:04,190
I guess she has a problem here.

92
00:07:25,670 --> 00:07:29,500
[A Prophet]

93
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:32,640
[Episode 19]

94
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,880
You think I can't catch you?

95
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,270
You little thing!

96
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:40,880
If I catch you,

97
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,390
I'll make you into

98
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,830
spicy chicken!

99
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,030
You really made me angry.

100
00:07:51,030 --> 00:07:51,960
I'm telling you.

101
00:08:00,210 --> 00:08:00,970
Oh my.

102
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,600
It's the Sect Master's room.

103
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,560
Why is there a coffin?

104
00:08:14,250 --> 00:08:18,380
[Tomb of Shangguan Chengming]

105
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,270
Shang...

106
00:08:17,590 --> 00:08:18,790
Four character‌s?

107
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:19,910
Who is it?

108
00:08:20,230 --> 00:08:20,830
Master.

109
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,440
Master.

110
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,520
I put it here.

111
00:08:28,830 --> 00:08:29,640
This thing

112
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:30,350
was...

113
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:32,549
brought from Pangzhou by Chief Batou.

114
00:08:33,110 --> 00:08:34,309
It was a long journey.

115
00:08:34,409 --> 00:08:36,570
I'm afraid someone tampered with it.

116
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:39,159
How about we open it and take a look?

117
00:08:42,110 --> 00:08:42,870
No rush.

118
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,710
Shangguan Chengming.

119
00:08:47,710 --> 00:08:49,840
Do you think this Shangguan Chengming

120
00:08:50,470 --> 00:08:51,830
could be my son?

121
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,280
To be honest,

122
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:56,080
this kid doesn't look like you at all.

123
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,610
I don't think he's your son.

124
00:08:59,710 --> 00:09:01,110
It's so mysterious.

125
00:09:03,870 --> 00:09:05,320
Did Li Yingjuan find him?

126
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:06,630
They...

127
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,160
Didn't you hear that?

128
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,280
That was a rooster crowing.

129
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:13,800
Let's go.

130
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,280
Let's talk inside.

131
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,800
Where did this chicken come from?

132
00:09:37,590 --> 00:09:38,920
Are you keeping a vigil?

133
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:42,920
You didn't sleep all night?

134
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,680
I did.

135
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,870
Just couldn't fall asleep.

136
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:46,750
What's wrong?

137
00:09:47,470 --> 00:09:48,280
Something on your mind?

138
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,110
No.

139
00:09:49,350 --> 00:09:49,960
Nothing at all.

140
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,560
Then why are you sitting
on my bed holding a chicken?

141
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,350
It's my guardian now.

142
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,040
Then keep your guardian away from me.

143
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:56,710
No can do.

144
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,990
I'm counting on it to make me some money

145
00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:00,160
so I can get a wife.

146
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,710
Do you even have a girlfriend?

147
00:10:02,710 --> 00:10:03,960
Talking about getting a wife.

148
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,350
Of course I do.

149
00:10:05,710 --> 00:10:07,560
We've been together for a while now.

150
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:09,280
How come I've never seen her?

151
00:10:09,710 --> 00:10:10,510
Is she a fairy?

152
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:11,920
Nonsense.

153
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:12,800
So you don't have one!

154
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,510
I do!

155
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:14,510
I might as well tell you,

156
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,560
her name is Liu Xijiao.

157
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,870
She really looks like a fairy,

158
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:18,400
like the ones in the murals.

159
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,440
When she was standing there,

160
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,230
Chen, who sells jelly noodles,

161
00:10:20,230 --> 00:10:21,630
couldn't even take his eyes off her.

162
00:10:21,630 --> 00:10:22,280
It's rea—

163
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,200
Master!

164
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,190
Master!

165
00:10:26,210 --> 00:10:28,010
Sounds like that crazy old lady.

166
00:10:29,830 --> 00:10:31,110
Don't move. I'll go.

167
00:10:31,110 --> 00:10:32,510
Watch my guardian for me.

168
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,680
Shangguan Chengming.

169
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,510
I've been thinking,

170
00:10:40,710 --> 00:10:43,110
you shouldn't be running scams these days.

171
00:10:43,230 --> 00:10:44,440
Just lay low.

172
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,160
Master!

173
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,350
Coming.

174
00:10:59,320 --> 00:10:59,830
Master!

175
00:10:59,830 --> 00:11:00,350
Ma'am.

176
00:11:00,350 --> 00:11:01,200
Look!

177
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,400
Look at my arms.

178
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,960
My niece and I are both like this.

179
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,510
We were scratched by ghosts!

180
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:07,230
The Zhang family must be trying
to trap our souls.

181
00:11:07,230 --> 00:11:09,470
They want to take our souls away!

182
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,990
What should we do?

183
00:11:10,990 --> 00:11:13,440
This is quite serious.

184
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:16,280
As they say, only a century-old evil ghost

185
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:19,080
can show its form.

186
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,350
What should we do?

187
00:11:20,350 --> 00:11:21,630
Master, please save us!

188
00:11:21,630 --> 00:11:23,160
Please save us!

189
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,440
Don't panic.

190
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,800
Don't panic.

191
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,560
This indeed

192
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,960
can't be cured
with just a few doses of medicine.

193
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,200
I need to go to your residence

194
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,800
and perform an exorcism
for the whole house.

195
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,200
Here's the plan.

196
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,510
I'll go get some
evil-warding artifacts first.

197
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:38,280
Wait for me here.

198
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:38,920
I'll be right back.

199
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,560
Okay.

200
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:40,710
Okay, Master.

201
00:11:44,710 --> 00:11:45,800
What are you doing?

202
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:48,990
I can handle this scam myself.

203
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:50,620
Sit down.

204
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,990
But honestly,

205
00:11:54,990 --> 00:11:56,990
I really can't handle

206
00:11:56,990 --> 00:11:59,040
this situation.

207
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,750
You gotta help me.

208
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:01,750
I'm telling you,

209
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:03,710
the scratches on that old lady's arm...

210
00:12:03,710 --> 00:12:05,800
I heard you guys talking just now.

211
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,920
That old lady

212
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,510
was bitten by a bug.

213
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:09,470
A bug?

214
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:11,640
There's a bug called the Ghost Crawler.

215
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:13,570
Its bite marks look just like that.

216
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,170
But

217
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:17,320
these bugs don't usually appear indoors.

218
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,920
Maybe someone is playing tricks.

219
00:12:20,230 --> 00:12:21,400
Whether someone is playing tricks or not,

220
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:22,590
I've already taken the money.

221
00:12:22,590 --> 00:12:24,230
I have to fix this for her.

222
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,890
What am I supposed to do?

223
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,210
What does this mean?

224
00:12:45,710 --> 00:12:47,230
Spirits of heaven,

225
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:48,990
spirits of earth,

226
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:51,280
demons and monsters, hear my decree.

227
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:54,360
Dogs bark in the east,
cats meow in the west,

228
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,830
the Day-Wandering God knows best.

229
00:12:56,990 --> 00:12:59,400
Copper bells pin down the headless demon!

230
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:04,040
Incense ash mixed with wine
breaks the spell.

231
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,200
Open!

232
00:13:29,210 --> 00:13:30,130
Aunt!

233
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,920
Why did you bring another scammer home?

234
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,830
Look at this place. It's a smoky mess.

235
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:34,400
Oh my!

236
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,590
Stop talking nonsense!

237
00:13:35,590 --> 00:13:36,990
You are being too rude!

238
00:13:36,990 --> 00:13:39,110
Master, please don't mind her.

239
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:40,800
Look,

240
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,590
Master.

241
00:13:41,590 --> 00:13:42,750
Look at her arm.

242
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:44,200
Look at her legs!

243
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,350
Aunt, I study medicine.

244
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:47,440
[Li Ling]

245
00:13:45,350 --> 00:13:46,590
How could I not know this?

246
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:47,800
These are just bug bites.

247
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,040
How could I not know
if they are bug bites or not?

248
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:52,710
This happened to me over 20 years ago.

249
00:13:52,710 --> 00:13:54,320
These are ghost scratches.

250
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:55,710
I didn't pay attention back then.

251
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:57,920
Then I almost died at the Zhangs'.

252
00:13:58,350 --> 00:13:58,990
Get out of here right now.

253
00:13:58,990 --> 00:13:59,990
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

254
00:13:59,990 --> 00:14:00,350
Get out.

255
00:14:00,350 --> 00:14:01,320
Li Ling!

256
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,320
Maybe I should have the authorities
throw you in jail.

257
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,470
Let's see how they can marry you there!

258
00:14:04,470 --> 00:14:05,440
Aunt!

259
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:15,590
Master,

260
00:14:15,990 --> 00:14:17,200
please forgive us.

261
00:14:17,870 --> 00:14:18,800
It's fine.

262
00:14:19,070 --> 00:14:19,900
Please.

263
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,400
Listen well, you evil spirits!

264
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:41,320
The Boundless Heavenly Lord is here today.

265
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,800
Dare not harm the innocent again.

266
00:14:43,990 --> 00:14:46,080
If you dare to come again,

267
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:48,920
I will ask the Celestial Master

268
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:52,200
to scatter your souls himself.

269
00:15:33,110 --> 00:15:35,750
Lord of the Red Feather!

270
00:15:49,620 --> 00:15:50,530
You may rise.

271
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,830
Ma'am,

272
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:56,120
have any strangers visited recently?

273
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:56,990
No,

274
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,360
absolutely not.

275
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:01,150
Any movement from the Zhang family?

276
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,630
They are preparing for the wedding.

277
00:16:02,630 --> 00:16:04,750
A lot of people are coming and going.

278
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,780
They didn't come looking for you?

279
00:16:07,470 --> 00:16:08,350
Master,

280
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:11,560
do you think

281
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:13,280
the Zhang family did this?

282
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:14,630
The Zhang family?

283
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:22,040
[Zhang Residence]

284
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:16,960
Where is he?

285
00:17:17,990 --> 00:17:19,599
Where did he go?

286
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:28,840
What's going on?

287
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,710
What's going on?

288
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,030
Liang.

289
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,470
Liang.

290
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:50,840
Xijiao?

291
00:17:50,930 --> 00:17:52,140
Liang.

292
00:17:52,230 --> 00:17:53,270
Xijiao.

293
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:54,470
Xijiao.

294
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:55,640
Liang,

295
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:56,360
what's wrong?

296
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:57,960
I missed you so much, Xijiao.

297
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,470
Liang?

298
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:00,200
Xijiao...

299
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,360
Liang, what's wrong?

300
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:02,230
Xijiao...

301
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,680
Wake up!

302
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:05,310
Liang, wake up!

303
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:05,750
Xijiao...

304
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:06,680
Liang!

305
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:07,510
Xijiao.

306
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,790
Liang, wake up!

307
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,400
You've been drugged!

308
00:18:11,710 --> 00:18:13,070
Liang, wake up!

309
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:14,310
Liang!

310
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,470
No, no, no!

311
00:18:15,470 --> 00:18:16,550
Liang!

312
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:17,400
Liang!

313
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:18,120
Liang...

314
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:18,840
Xijiao.

315
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:19,440
Liang!

316
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:21,160
Xijiao.

317
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:22,580
Xijiao.

318
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,690
Liang, are you feeling better?

319
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:25,310
Liang.

320
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,000
Xijiao...

321
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:45,400
Liang.

322
00:18:45,470 --> 00:18:46,600
My chest is so tight.

323
00:18:46,620 --> 00:18:47,820
I feel like I'm dying.

324
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:49,270
I can't breathe.

325
00:18:49,270 --> 00:18:49,880
Liang!

326
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,230
-I can't breathe.
-Liang.

327
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:53,360
I'm burning up.

328
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:58,880
Xijiao.

329
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:00,920
Xijiao...

330
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:03,150
[Liu Xijiao]

331
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:03,030
Xijiao...

332
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:05,160
Xijiao...

333
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:08,120
I miss you so much.

334
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,230
What are you hiding?

335
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:32,110
Nothing.

336
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,470
Let me see.

337
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:46,470
I just wrote it randomly.

338
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,240
I was just saying that casually.

339
00:19:52,470 --> 00:19:54,600
You're actually learning to write it?

340
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,230
What did you bring me?

341
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:05,170
You managed to write "Liu" and "Jiao,"

342
00:20:05,170 --> 00:20:07,280
the two difficult characters.

343
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:09,510
Why can't you write "Xi"?

344
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,510
I learned the hard ones first.

345
00:20:11,510 --> 00:20:13,120
From hard to easy.

346
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:15,110
This pig trotter is delicious.

347
00:20:16,030 --> 00:20:16,880
How about I teach you?

348
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:17,510
Okay.

349
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:22,070
Look.

350
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:24,470
First there's a heart.

351
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:27,600
And on the right, there's a house.

352
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:31,200
Then a "sun" at the bottom.

353
00:20:33,270 --> 00:20:34,640
Got it!

354
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:37,030
It means

355
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,880
the two of us,

356
00:20:39,310 --> 00:20:40,440
of one mind,

357
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:42,200
moving into a house

358
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:44,200
and living together.

359
00:20:46,070 --> 00:20:46,680
Right?

360
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:53,620
I can't help you if you can't remember it.

361
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,840
I won't be able to teach you
in the future.

362
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:56,880
Why?

363
00:21:01,750 --> 00:21:02,990
I'm getting married.

364
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:08,490
Who are you marrying?

365
00:21:09,270 --> 00:21:10,460
They didn't tell me.

366
00:21:11,750 --> 00:21:13,400
The sect arranged it all.

367
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:15,890
They said he's quite old,

368
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:17,780
but his family has some money.

369
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:21,030
The sect must have sold me
for a good price.

370
00:21:25,550 --> 00:21:26,710
I've made some money,

371
00:21:26,710 --> 00:21:27,990
enough to buy a sow,

372
00:21:27,990 --> 00:21:29,270
but not enough for a boar yet.

373
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:30,710
But I know where they sell them.

374
00:21:30,710 --> 00:21:31,960
Then I'll mate them,

375
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,310
and they'll have a bunch of piglets,

376
00:21:33,310 --> 00:21:34,790
so we can make more money.

377
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,470
Stay in the sect and work hard.

378
00:21:37,120 --> 00:21:38,800
Save more of your earnings.

379
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:43,780
You'll definitely...

380
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:51,660
You'll definitely find a better woman
than me to be your wife someday.

381
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:05,550
That's true.

382
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,310
With my current skills,

383
00:22:10,550 --> 00:22:12,310
I can't even afford pig trotters.

384
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:13,640
At least the man you're going to marry

385
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:14,310
is rich.

386
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:16,350
He can buy you trotters

387
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,750
and give you a good life.

388
00:22:29,710 --> 00:22:31,910
Let's both take good care of ourselves.

389
00:22:54,580 --> 00:22:55,840
Take care of yourself.

390
00:22:59,350 --> 00:23:01,810
[Liu Xijiao]

391
00:23:02,420 --> 00:23:05,470
[Liang]

392
00:23:12,030 --> 00:23:12,880
You're awake?

393
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:14,790
Why are you here?

394
00:23:14,840 --> 00:23:16,040
Good thing I was here.

395
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:16,990
The poison you got

396
00:23:16,990 --> 00:23:18,440
could only be cleansed with water.

397
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,400
How is it?

398
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,640
Feeling better?

399
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,600
Much better.

400
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:23,940
I was set up by that guy.

401
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:29,070
Leave now.

402
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,030
Didn't I say

403
00:23:30,060 --> 00:23:32,200
I was going to make money on my own
this time?

404
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,920
I just saved you.

405
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,360
And now

406
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:38,370
you're telling me to leave
the moment you wake up?

407
00:23:38,710 --> 00:23:40,070
But seriously, Liang.

408
00:23:40,650 --> 00:23:41,990
You really have a girlfriend

409
00:23:41,990 --> 00:23:43,230
named Liu Xijiao?

410
00:23:43,820 --> 00:23:46,020
I heard you muttering her name just now.

411
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:48,070
My love is already dead.

412
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:50,700
There's nothing to mutter about.

413
00:23:51,750 --> 00:23:53,510
You didn't just mutter about Liu Xijiao.

414
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:54,970
You muttered about me too.

415
00:23:55,270 --> 00:23:56,470
You said something...

416
00:23:56,470 --> 00:23:57,710
about a coffin.

417
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,120
What else did I say?

418
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,680
You said everything—

419
00:24:01,710 --> 00:24:04,110
things you should and shouldn't have said.

420
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:09,030
Well, I...

421
00:24:09,060 --> 00:24:10,140
Let me ask you,

422
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:12,460
are you really the Sect Master's son?

423
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,270
I...

424
00:24:15,270 --> 00:24:16,000
Don't say it!

425
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,550
I have a loose tongue.

426
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,640
Whether you are or not,

427
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,160
you're still my brother.

428
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:23,920
Let me tell you the truth.

429
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,120
The Sect Master found

430
00:24:25,120 --> 00:24:26,750
Shangguan Chengming's coffin somewhere.

431
00:24:26,750 --> 00:24:27,880
So he suspects you're not his son.

432
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,440
Then he set up a trap for you.

433
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:30,840
I didn't want you to get involved,

434
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:31,680
so I tried to stop you from coming.

435
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,740
Do you understand?

436
00:24:34,650 --> 00:24:37,040
This is Shangguan Chengming's coffin.

437
00:24:37,230 --> 00:24:39,990
The Sect Master got it last night.

438
00:24:39,990 --> 00:24:42,650
Since the coffin
arrived at the sect last night,

439
00:24:42,730 --> 00:24:44,190
why hasn't the Sect Master

440
00:24:44,510 --> 00:24:46,160
sent anyone to find me yet?

441
00:24:46,310 --> 00:24:48,110
He is the Sect Master, after all.

442
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,360
While you were setting a trap for him,

443
00:24:51,360 --> 00:24:53,880
he was actually setting one for you.

444
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,710
The Sect Master often says

445
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:57,750
that everyone has a weakness.

446
00:24:58,120 --> 00:24:59,440
Grasping their weakness

447
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:00,780
is equivalent to

448
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:02,330
having leverage over them.

449
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:03,740
Do you have a weakness?

450
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:06,840
I don't.

451
00:25:08,230 --> 00:25:10,690
How are things between you
and Jiang Feiyan?

452
00:25:14,120 --> 00:25:14,920
Liang,

453
00:25:15,930 --> 00:25:17,260
since I'm here,

454
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:18,650
I won't leave.

455
00:25:20,230 --> 00:25:21,750
Nor will I abandon you.

456
00:25:23,710 --> 00:25:24,750
My good brother.

457
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:27,230
Oh, right.

458
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:28,880
That master

459
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:30,370
is no ordinary man.

460
00:25:30,550 --> 00:25:32,510
It seems what happened to the Li family

461
00:25:32,510 --> 00:25:34,710
was indeed related to the Zhang family.

462
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:37,030
Then where did this master go?

463
00:25:37,710 --> 00:25:38,770
But why do you think

464
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,920
he came to this wilderness?

465
00:25:48,230 --> 00:25:49,230
Mountain peaks rise in a chain,

466
00:25:49,230 --> 00:25:50,960
with clouds winding around their waists

467
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:53,750
and a clear stream
meandering through the valleys—

468
00:25:53,750 --> 00:25:55,610
this is a land with good feng shui.

469
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:58,270
Feng shui

470
00:25:58,270 --> 00:25:59,600
is about wind and water.

471
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:01,790
Can you walk now?

472
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:03,070
No problem.

473
00:26:03,310 --> 00:26:03,920
Let's go.

474
00:26:04,360 --> 00:26:05,760
Let's check downstream.

475
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,440
Li Ling?

476
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:28,440
Li Ling?

477
00:26:29,070 --> 00:26:30,800
She's Mrs. Li's niece, I think.

478
00:26:30,820 --> 00:26:31,470
Get out of here right now.

479
00:26:31,470 --> 00:26:32,470
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

480
00:26:32,470 --> 00:26:32,840
Get out.

481
00:26:32,840 --> 00:26:33,750
Li Ling!

482
00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:35,840
Maybe I should have the authorities
throw you in jail.

483
00:26:35,840 --> 00:26:36,960
Let's see how they can marry you there!

484
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:38,160
Aunt!

485
00:26:39,730 --> 00:26:43,390
This paper figure looks like the work
of the sect's spiritual con.

486
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,990
When I was performing the ritual
at the Li family...

487
00:26:44,990 --> 00:26:45,440
Master.

488
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,160
I found that Mrs. Li

489
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,560
wasn't that crazy.

490
00:26:47,580 --> 00:26:48,510
Oh, right.

491
00:26:48,990 --> 00:26:49,840
You were right about one thing.

492
00:26:49,840 --> 00:26:51,160
It really was a bug.

493
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:54,410
Could it be someone from the sect
running a scam?

494
00:26:59,270 --> 00:27:02,330
Could it be a misunderstanding
between our own people?

495
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:07,600
This is the Zhang family's ancestral tomb.

496
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:10,000
Maybe it's really a soul-trapping ritual.

497
00:27:10,380 --> 00:27:11,340
Liang.

498
00:27:13,710 --> 00:27:15,790
[Xijiao]

499
00:27:17,770 --> 00:27:18,530
Liang.

500
00:27:24,710 --> 00:27:25,920
Liu Xi...

501
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:29,680
L-Liang...

502
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,230
Liang!

503
00:27:31,260 --> 00:27:31,920
Liang, are you going?

504
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:32,990
I'm going to the Zhang family to ask them!

505
00:27:32,990 --> 00:27:34,030
Liang! Liang!

506
00:27:34,030 --> 00:27:34,960
Listen to me!

507
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:35,990
If you rush over there recklessly,

508
00:27:35,990 --> 00:27:37,470
you won't get any answers.

509
00:27:37,500 --> 00:27:38,310
Didn't you tell me?

510
00:27:38,310 --> 00:27:39,360
This trap is aimed at me.

511
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:40,470
Calm down first.

512
00:27:40,910 --> 00:27:41,950
Li Yingjuan...

513
00:27:42,550 --> 00:27:44,360
Li Yingjuan should know a lot
about the Zhang family.

514
00:27:44,360 --> 00:27:45,640
Let's go find her and ask for details.

515
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:46,920
Every wrong has its cause,
and every debt has its debtor.

516
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,840
If this is really related
to the Zhang family,

517
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:50,120
I'll help you

518
00:27:50,470 --> 00:27:51,880
without you even asking.

519
00:27:56,310 --> 00:27:57,160
Ma'am,

520
00:27:57,270 --> 00:27:59,330
what exactly is this soul-trapping?

521
00:28:00,230 --> 00:28:01,070
Ma'am!

522
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:16,500
She's not dead.

523
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:18,050
She just passed out.

524
00:28:18,990 --> 00:28:20,250
Shangguan Chengming.

525
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:25,790
I knew you'd come.

526
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:29,820
The master the Zhang family hired
is actually you, Second Master?

527
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:32,680
Big Teapot.

528
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:35,710
You're still tough as nails.

529
00:28:35,740 --> 00:28:38,220
My poison didn't even take you down.

530
00:28:38,550 --> 00:28:41,120
Looks like I went too easy on you.

531
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:42,710
What?

532
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,200
Are you mad?

533
00:28:44,710 --> 00:28:46,970
You're not even greeting your grandmaster?

534
00:28:46,970 --> 00:28:47,760
Tell you what.

535
00:28:47,760 --> 00:28:49,200
I'll apologize to you.

536
00:28:53,120 --> 00:28:54,470
I'm talking to you.

537
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,090
Cat got your tongue?

538
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:58,750
Silly Liang.

539
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:03,990
Second Master.

540
00:29:08,840 --> 00:29:12,390
These days,
any kind of trash can join the sect.

541
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:16,380
You have quite the appetite,
Second Master.

542
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:18,230
From the Zhangs to the Lis.

543
00:29:19,710 --> 00:29:21,600
Is one family not enough for you?

544
00:29:21,600 --> 00:29:22,750
You know nothing.

545
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:24,640
This is a double-sided scam.

546
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:27,550
It's just playing both sides for profit.

547
00:29:27,780 --> 00:29:28,960
What's so hard to understand?

548
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:32,040
This scam was passed down
by the old Sect Master.

549
00:29:32,300 --> 00:29:32,990
The current Sect Master

550
00:29:32,990 --> 00:29:34,990
became the Sect Master

551
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:37,200
because he took on this scam.

552
00:29:37,230 --> 00:29:39,270
Then I should congratulate you,
Second Master.

553
00:29:39,270 --> 00:29:40,880
If this double-sided scam is so important,

554
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:43,230
why did the Li family come to me?

555
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,470
This double-sided scam

556
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,960
requires killing.

557
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:51,730
Do you have the guts?

558
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,230
Greenhorn.

559
00:29:56,990 --> 00:29:59,190
To perform this soul-trapping ritual,

560
00:29:59,750 --> 00:30:02,230
you need to stuff a living person

561
00:30:02,790 --> 00:30:04,920
into a water vat.

562
00:30:06,310 --> 00:30:07,470
And then,

563
00:30:07,600 --> 00:30:08,840
you drown her...

564
00:30:10,840 --> 00:30:11,970
with your own hands.

565
00:30:12,920 --> 00:30:13,990
Fifty years ago,

566
00:30:14,590 --> 00:30:16,890
the Li family kept making things difficult
for our old Sect Master.

567
00:30:16,890 --> 00:30:17,720
Seal the soul.

568
00:30:17,960 --> 00:30:18,920
He had no choice

569
00:30:18,950 --> 00:30:21,870
but to use the soul-trapping ritual.

570
00:30:25,030 --> 00:30:26,200
All these years,

571
00:30:26,280 --> 00:30:29,030
it wasn't just Miss Zhang's soul
that was trapped, right?

572
00:30:29,030 --> 00:30:29,990
The Zhang family

573
00:30:30,440 --> 00:30:31,440
and the Li family—

574
00:30:31,840 --> 00:30:33,320
both families have shed
quite a lot of blood.

575
00:30:33,320 --> 00:30:36,450
This soul-trapping ritual
actually worked every time?

576
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,430
Ever since the first time
it was performed,

577
00:30:38,430 --> 00:30:40,710
the Li family's eldest son, Li Yingfu,

578
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:43,600
has risen through the ranks
and landed a government position.

579
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:45,070
As long as it works once,

580
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:46,440
everyone will think

581
00:30:46,510 --> 00:30:48,310
it's all thanks to
the soul-trapping ritual.

582
00:30:48,310 --> 00:30:50,840
The Zhang family was jealous
of the Li family.

583
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:54,020
The wicked prey on the destitute.

584
00:30:54,790 --> 00:30:58,550
The Zhang family also asked the Sect Master
to perform the soul-trapping ritual.

585
00:30:58,550 --> 00:31:00,400
So he conveniently turned

586
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:03,270
the soul-trapping rituals of both families

587
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,860
into a double-sided scam.

588
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:07,250
The old Sect Master—

589
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,400
I respect him.

590
00:31:08,470 --> 00:31:10,230
But our current Sect Master

591
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,120
is quite something.

592
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:16,030
He made the Zhang and Li families,
who were once close,

593
00:31:16,030 --> 00:31:17,470
grow suspicious of,

594
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:18,840
envious of,

595
00:31:18,840 --> 00:31:20,400
and hateful toward each other.

596
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,840
The desires in their hearts

597
00:31:21,840 --> 00:31:23,790
are like algae at the bottom of a river,

598
00:31:23,790 --> 00:31:25,310
tangling tighter and tighter.

599
00:31:25,310 --> 00:31:28,440
The more they hate each other,
the more the sect profits.

600
00:31:29,070 --> 00:31:30,470
I'm just curious about one thing.

601
00:31:30,470 --> 00:31:32,550
This soul-trapping scam
has lasted for 50 years.

602
00:31:32,550 --> 00:31:34,750
The Zhang and Li families
have trapped so many girls.

603
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:36,440
Has there never been any trouble?

604
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,310
Good question.

605
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:38,680
Today,

606
00:31:38,790 --> 00:31:40,750
I'll explain it to you in detail.

607
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:43,680
Actually, it's not just the girls

608
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:46,880
from the Zhang and Li families
who were trapped.

609
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:47,890
There are also

610
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:50,070
the girls from Yuehaitang.

611
00:31:51,580 --> 00:31:54,300
Speaking of which,
I feel sorry for those girls.

612
00:31:54,560 --> 00:31:56,430
Such beautiful girls,

613
00:31:56,530 --> 00:32:00,930
yet their lives are worth less than the dogs
used for spiritual cons in the sect.

614
00:32:01,470 --> 00:32:02,990
Sometimes I think

615
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:04,880
the Fifth Batou

616
00:32:04,940 --> 00:32:07,110
is really ruthless.

617
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,880
They were all...

618
00:32:09,270 --> 00:32:09,710
Silly Liang!

619
00:32:09,710 --> 00:32:10,970
Shangguan Chengming!

620
00:32:11,120 --> 00:32:11,920
Is he crazy?

621
00:32:11,950 --> 00:32:12,830
I'm telling you,

622
00:32:12,830 --> 00:32:14,030
keep an eye on him!

623
00:32:14,230 --> 00:32:16,400
This case is the legacy
of our Tianxiang Sect.

624
00:32:16,400 --> 00:32:17,790
If you dare to make a move against it,

625
00:32:17,790 --> 00:32:20,120
the Sect Master will definitely kill you.

626
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:23,840
Jiang Feiyan!

627
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:27,990
Jiang Feiyan!

628
00:32:28,990 --> 00:32:31,030
Jiang Feiyan, come out here!

629
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:32,840
Jiang Feiyan!

630
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:34,050
Why are you yelling?

631
00:32:34,710 --> 00:32:35,680
Jiang Feiyan,

632
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:37,120
you jinx!

633
00:32:37,150 --> 00:32:38,300
Liang!

634
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:40,550
You watched our brothers and sisters
in the sect die without doing anything!

635
00:32:40,550 --> 00:32:42,600
Did the blood wine you drank at the altar
mean nothing to you?

636
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:43,750
Calm down, Liang!

637
00:32:43,750 --> 00:32:44,880
I can't calm down!

638
00:32:45,270 --> 00:32:47,650
The woman I love died
an unexplained death,

639
00:32:47,650 --> 00:32:48,880
and it was all because of her!

640
00:32:48,880 --> 00:32:50,540
What are you going crazy over?

641
00:32:51,160 --> 00:32:52,560
What is he talking about?

642
00:32:52,650 --> 00:32:54,400
Was there a girl named Liu Xijiao

643
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:56,030
in Yuehaitang before?

644
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:01,140
Yes, there was such a girl.

645
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:03,020
And there were Lin Wan'er, Song Xue'e,

646
00:33:03,020 --> 00:33:04,300
and many others.

647
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:05,600
It was all the sect's arrangement.

648
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:07,660
You used them all for soul-trapping?

649
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:09,400
That's right.

650
00:33:09,680 --> 00:33:11,630
I handled every single one of them myself.

651
00:33:11,630 --> 00:33:13,280
What right do you have to act up here?

652
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:14,170
Get out of here.

653
00:33:14,930 --> 00:33:16,000
You're too ruthless!

654
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:16,810
Liang!

655
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:29,130
How are things
on the Zhang family's side now?

656
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:32,480
The wedding and the ritual
have all been prepared.

657
00:33:33,600 --> 00:33:36,060
Shangguan Chengming is already
in the game.

658
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:38,790
You need to teach him a good lesson.

659
00:33:38,790 --> 00:33:39,270
Yes.

660
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:41,210
But with you at the Zhang family,

661
00:33:41,210 --> 00:33:42,270
I can rest assured.

662
00:33:45,120 --> 00:33:45,710
By the way,

663
00:33:45,710 --> 00:33:47,640
I found a little something for you.

664
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:49,960
A Xuande Jar?

665
00:33:50,840 --> 00:33:52,880
It's in better condition
than yours, right?

666
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:53,270
Yes,

667
00:33:53,710 --> 00:33:54,910
much better, Master.

668
00:33:56,200 --> 00:33:56,790
Master,

669
00:33:56,900 --> 00:33:58,790
you're the only one who'd remember

670
00:33:58,790 --> 00:34:00,070
such a little thing for me.

671
00:34:00,070 --> 00:34:01,790
I really love it.

672
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,600
Then keep it and enjoy it.

673
00:34:06,360 --> 00:34:07,490
Sixth Batou is here.

674
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:09,130
Then I'll take my leave first, Master.

675
00:34:09,130 --> 00:34:09,659
Alright.

676
00:34:15,340 --> 00:34:16,030
Master.

677
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:24,770
Shangguan Chengming went
to find Jiang Feiyan.

678
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:28,239
Now that all the players are here,

679
00:34:28,460 --> 00:34:30,100
the show can begin.

680
00:34:36,340 --> 00:34:38,000
[Zhang Residence]

681
00:34:43,290 --> 00:34:44,969
[Zhang Yinhua]

682
00:34:45,989 --> 00:34:48,239
Here they come!

683
00:34:49,190 --> 00:34:51,440
Congratulations!

684
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:55,510
Master, the Young Master is here!

685
00:34:55,020 --> 00:34:57,210
[Zhang Yuanfan]

686
00:34:55,510 --> 00:34:56,800
Congratulations!

687
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:20,420
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

688
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:23,570
Second bow to the parents!

689
00:35:25,990 --> 00:35:27,990
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

690
00:35:31,110 --> 00:35:32,970
The newlyweds will now serve tea!

691
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:58,440
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

692
00:35:58,440 --> 00:35:59,800
Congratulations!

693
00:35:59,850 --> 00:36:01,710
Congratulations, Master Zhang!

694
00:36:13,550 --> 00:36:15,210
When you get to the other side,

695
00:36:15,710 --> 00:36:17,910
I will burn plenty of joss paper for you.

696
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:21,070
You must also bless our family

697
00:36:21,550 --> 00:36:23,110
with wealth, glory,

698
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,510
happiness, and longevity.

699
00:37:11,010 --> 00:37:11,810
Seal the soul!

700
00:38:07,070 --> 00:38:08,160
The ritual is complete.

701
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:09,490
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

702
00:38:09,490 --> 00:38:11,690
You've gained another 10 years of life.

703
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,240
I'm recovered.

704
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:23,510
I can feel it.

705
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:25,990
I can feel it!

706
00:38:36,210 --> 00:38:38,000
[Li Ling]

707
00:38:38,950 --> 00:38:41,620
[Li Residence]

708
00:39:05,990 --> 00:39:07,200
For this scam to work,

709
00:39:07,630 --> 00:39:10,090
the ritual needs to look like
it's complete.

710
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,640
So those girls have to be put in the vats.

711
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:15,420
Because the fools who paid

712
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:17,690
will check if they are really dead.

713
00:39:17,890 --> 00:39:18,600
As for

714
00:39:18,630 --> 00:39:19,630
the soul-trapping nails,

715
00:39:19,630 --> 00:39:22,030
they are fake ones I had
the Fourth Batou make in advance.

716
00:39:22,030 --> 00:39:23,830
Nailing them in won't kill them.

717
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:24,990
We just need to fool those people first.

718
00:39:24,990 --> 00:39:26,190
So that means

719
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:28,630
Liu Xijiao is still alive.

720
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:29,800
Where is she?

721
00:39:30,150 --> 00:39:31,150
Even if I tell you,

722
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:33,920
you can't go looking for her.

723
00:39:34,190 --> 00:39:36,360
According to the rules
of the Tianxiang Sect,

724
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,760
you should know very well

725
00:39:37,990 --> 00:39:40,050
how they will treat me and those girls

726
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:41,660
who have left the sect,

727
00:39:42,720 --> 00:39:44,320
and what will happen to them.

728
00:39:44,470 --> 00:39:45,070
So,

729
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:49,210
you've been saving these girls all along?

730
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,760
These girls have had a hard life.

731
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:54,800
Someone has to

732
00:39:55,470 --> 00:39:57,330
shield them from some disasters.

733
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:59,150
However...

734
00:40:00,630 --> 00:40:02,290
how did you end up in this scam?

735
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,560
It's the Sect Master.

736
00:40:14,070 --> 00:40:14,470
Yanzi,

737
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:16,010
where have you been?

738
00:40:16,190 --> 00:40:17,550
I was worried about Shangguan Chengming

739
00:40:17,550 --> 00:40:18,630
being involved in the scam.

740
00:40:18,630 --> 00:40:20,760
With you gone, I felt even more uneasy.

741
00:40:21,240 --> 00:40:23,150
What are you saying, Second Master?

742
00:40:23,150 --> 00:40:25,950
I just went to prepare
some dishes for your drinks.

743
00:40:27,510 --> 00:40:28,840
You're the best to me.

744
00:40:43,470 --> 00:40:44,280
Yanzi,

745
00:40:44,550 --> 00:40:46,470
if we could be

746
00:40:46,470 --> 00:40:47,190
of one mind

747
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:49,070
from now on,

748
00:40:49,470 --> 00:40:51,470
imagine how good our meals would be.

749
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:54,550
Just eat.

750
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:11,990
Master!

751
00:41:21,320 --> 00:41:22,250
Have some water.

752
00:41:27,630 --> 00:41:28,490
Master, you...

753
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:34,030
The ritual has just been completed.

754
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,550
Why is my health

755
00:41:38,110 --> 00:41:40,070
getting worse?

756
00:41:40,240 --> 00:41:40,720
Well...

757
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:10,470
Master!

758
00:42:13,510 --> 00:42:14,070
Master!

759
00:42:15,240 --> 00:42:15,990
Where is she?

760
00:42:16,470 --> 00:42:17,440
Where is Li Ling?

761
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:17,960
Well...

762
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:19,590
I'll go

763
00:42:19,590 --> 00:42:21,400
bring that witch over here right now!

764
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,320
Follow me!

765
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:36,980
Who are you?

766
00:42:37,190 --> 00:42:38,770
How dare you brandish weapons
in Zhang Residence?

767
00:42:38,770 --> 00:42:39,850
Cut the crap.

768
00:42:40,070 --> 00:42:41,200
Take her away!

769
00:42:41,300 --> 00:42:42,300
Don't touch her!

770
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,400
Catch them!

771
00:42:54,280 --> 00:42:55,140
Second Master!

772
00:42:59,630 --> 00:43:00,490
Take them away.

773
00:43:01,550 --> 00:43:02,150
Move!

774
00:43:02,400 --> 00:43:02,750
Hurry up!

775
00:43:02,750 --> 00:43:03,360
Move!

776
00:43:07,590 --> 00:43:08,240
Here.

777
00:43:08,670 --> 00:43:09,760
Have some water.

778
00:43:10,110 --> 00:43:11,190
Don't worry.

779
00:43:11,190 --> 00:43:11,990
Once the boat arrives

780
00:43:11,990 --> 00:43:13,400
and Chengming settles things
with the captain,

781
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:15,000
we'll get you out of Yucheng.

782
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:18,960
It will be fine.

783
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:20,770
Have some water.

784
00:43:53,160 --> 00:43:55,470
[In the next episode]

785
00:43:55,540 --> 00:43:57,630
What are you doing, Second Master?

786
00:43:58,760 --> 00:43:59,900
With that brat around,

787
00:43:59,900 --> 00:44:01,280
he'll drag you down with him
sooner or later.

788
00:44:01,280 --> 00:44:02,140
Second Master!

789
00:44:02,360 --> 00:44:04,280
Jiang Feiyan saved Li Ling?

790
00:44:04,360 --> 00:44:05,640
She exposed the scam.

791
00:44:05,680 --> 00:44:07,210
Between Li Ling and Feiyan,

792
00:44:07,310 --> 00:44:08,940
you can only save one.

793
00:44:09,760 --> 00:44:10,550
Feiyan!

794
00:44:11,070 --> 00:44:11,880
Watch out!

795
00:44:14,190 --> 00:44:14,990
Second Master!

796
00:44:14,990 --> 00:44:16,390
Look carefully! It's me!

797
00:44:16,620 --> 00:44:17,910
Brat!

798
00:44:18,400 --> 00:44:20,130
You're the one I'm here to kill!

799
00:44:20,840 --> 00:44:22,030
Interesting.

800
00:44:22,430 --> 00:44:24,630
When do you think
the fish will take the bait?
